sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant R as Resolver
    participant K as Kernel network stack
    participant LB as Load balancer
    participant S as Server
    B->>R: resolve the hostname
    R-->>B: address
    B->>K: connect()
    K->>LB: SYN
    LB-->>K: SYN-ACK
    K->>LB: ACK
    Note over K,LB: three-way handshake done, congestion window starts small
    B->>LB: TLS ClientHello
    LB-->>B: certificate, keys agreed
    B->>LB: HTTP request
    LB->>S: forward to a healthy backend
    S-->>LB: response
    LB-->>B: bytes back, window growing each round trip
    Note over B: first paint waits on DNS, handshakes, and the first round trip — not on bandwidth
